  {
    "id": 2003017110030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "八宮めぐる、完全復活です！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301711/2003017110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう、おめでとう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いろいろあったな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003017110040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへ……だねー\r\n勉強になりました！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301711/2003017110040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003017110050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "やりすぎ、ダメ、絶対！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301711/2003017110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "標語みたいだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "メイクさんから聞いたんだけど、\r\n原因、つけすぎだったらしいな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺はそこからよくわからなかったんだけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003017110060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うんうん\r\nわたしも聞いて『そうなの？』ってなった",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301711/2003017110060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003017110070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "難しいねー",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301711/2003017110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "担当さんも『トラブルがあるかもしれない』って\r\n教えてくれてたのに、防げなくてすまない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003017110080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ええっ！？\r\nプロデューサーのせいじゃなくない？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301711/2003017110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003017110090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だってパッチテストして問題なかったし、\r\n大丈夫だーってわたしも思ってたし",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301711/2003017110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003017110100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "メイクさん、『めぐるちゃんいろいろしすぎ！』って\r\nびっくりしてたくらいだし",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301711/2003017110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003017110110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "『やりすぎる』がどれくらいなのか\r\n全然わかんなかったのが敗因というか……！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301711/2003017110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……！\r\nあんなにいろいろ出てるのに、つける種類は案外少ないよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003017110120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "『自分に必要なものを選んでね！』で、\r\n『全部やってね！』じゃなかったってことだねー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301711/2003017110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003017110130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしの場合、ほとんど何もしないほうが\r\n調子が良くなるとは思わなかったけど……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301711/2003017110130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐる、ちゃんと食べるし動くからなぁ\r\n今のバランスがいいんだろうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003017110140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ねー",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301711/2003017110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "企業さんも慣れてるふうだったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『契約期間中に他社製品の使用を言わなければ問題ない』\r\nこれは今回に限らずだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003017110150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん、優しいメールくれたね",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301711/2003017110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003017110160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "肌に直接つけるものだから、\r\n合う合わないはどうしたってあるよって",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301711/2003017110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003017110170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "せっかくお仕事もらえたんだし、\r\nいい機会でもあったし、使っていきたかったけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301711/2003017110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今のめぐるじゃなくて、\r\n少し先のめぐるにはすごく合うかもしれないから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そこでまた試してみる……とかかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003017110180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301711/2003017110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003017110190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "もうちょっと大人になったら\r\nまた試してみる！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
